# Project doctrine

## Purpose
invoice-sync receives Partner invoice webhooks, stores them in PostgreSQL, and a worker pushes each invoice to the Ledgerly accounting API. Every invoice must reach Ledgerly exactly once; duplicates are the most expensive failure. Finance reconciles a nightly CSV each morning (New York time).

## Platform pins
- Node.js 22 (package.json engines).

## Constraints
- Ledgerly is the accounting system of record.

## Settings
- Ledger: on
